---
title: AdviseCare - State Machine - Emergency Access Request
---

stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> pending : staff request access with a justification
    pending --> pending : requester rewords the justification
    pending --> approved : first Steward approves with scopeExpiresAt
    pending --> rejected : first Steward rejects with a reason
    state approved {
        [*] --> active
        active --> ended : scopeExpiresAt passes
    }
    approved --> [*]
    rejected --> [*]
